# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file, patches or ignores known vulnerabilities.
version: v1.25.1
ignore:
  SNYK-JS-ADMZIP-21707815:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          adm-zip has no fixed version: 0.6.1 is the latest published release and every version
          is affected (CVE-2026-116137, published 2026-10-25). It reaches this project only through
          Sanity's CLI tooling (@module-federation/dts-plugin below @sanity/workbench-cli and
          @sanity/cli-build), which extracts the type archives of Sanity's own module-federation
          remotes while building; nothing in the static studio bundle runs it. Revisit once
          adm-zip publishes a patched release.
        expires: 2026-11-25T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-BRACES-19963945:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          braces has no fixed version: 3.0.3 is the latest published release and every version is
          affected (CVE-2026-93687). It reaches this project only through Sanity's CLI tooling
          (micromatch, chokidar and fast-glob below @sanity/cli and @sanity/codegen), which expands
          glob patterns from this repository's own configuration and never outside input. Revisit
          once braces publishes a patched release.
        expires: 2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-PICOMATCH-21248802:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          picomatch has no fixed version: 4.0.7 is the latest published release and every version
          is affected (CVE-2026-112366). It reaches this project only through tooling: chokidar and
          anymatch below @sanity/codegen (Sanity's CLI, through sanity), and vitest as the optional
          peer of get-it below @sanity/client (through @sanity/vision). Both compile glob patterns
          from this repository's own configuration, never outside input, and neither is part of the
          static studio bundle. Revisit once picomatch publishes a patched release.
        expires: 2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z
patch: {}
